== Governing migration rule ==
<pre>
design writing ≠ implemented namespace object
wanted object ≠ implemented object
category membership ≠ documented category page
semantic annotation ≠ authored Property page
specification ≠ deployed capability
file metadata record ≠ available binary
</pre>

V2 preserves these different forms of evidence and states which layer a claim refers to.

